it Kernels<\/b>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Available in bulk quantities, packed as per international standards to ensure <\/span><b>freshness and long shelf life<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Why Choose Bombay Foodstuff Groundnut Kernels?<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Premium quality sourcing from trusted farms.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hygienic cleaning, grading, and processing.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wide range suitable for <\/span><b>B2B food industries and bulk buyers<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Competitive pricing with global export standards.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bombay Foodstuff supplies premium groundnut kernels (peanuts) valued for their high oil and protein content. Widely used in edible oil extraction, snacks, and food processing, our kernels are available raw, roasted, or processed. With their natural flavor, nutty taste, and crunchy texture, they are ideal for bulk buyers in the food, confectionery, and oil industries worldwide.<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":1211,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[25],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-822","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-uncategorized","first","instock","shipping-taxable","product-type-simple"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product\/822","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/bo